    if frame height is modified at run time. In such cases, the
    structure is freed and reallocated for modified frame height.

    BUG=aomedia:3031
    BUG=oss-fuzz:33470
    BUG=oss-fuzz:33480
    BUG=oss-fuzz:33505

    Change-Id: I434263cb44402d540c3c10ed7dc3c4c471365eae

